cff-version: 1.2.0
title: scorebook
message: If you refer to this project, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: TEJAS
    alias: Surge77
repository-code: "https://github.com/Surge77/scorebook"
abstract: >-
  A loader and cleaning layer for Cricsheet's IPL ball-by-ball archive —
  295,732 deliveries across 1,243 matches and 19 seasons — that documents the
  traps the data sets: a season label no string rule can parse correctly, an
  undocumented delivery column disagreeing with the documented one on 12% of
  rows, and three kinds of null needing three different treatments.
keywords:
  - exploratory-data-analysis
  - cricket
  - ipl
  - pandas
  - data-cleaning
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-11"
references:
  - type: data
    title: Cricsheet — Indian Premier League ball-by-ball data
    authors:
      - family-names: Rushe
        given-names: Stephen
    url: "https://cricsheet.org/matches/"
    notes: >-
      The data this project analyses. Not redistributed here; it carries its own
      terms and is downloaded on demand.
